<title>USA: Linens'n Things Q2 same store sales up 6 pct. [CORRECTED 01:40 GMT 3/7]</title>
<headline>Linens'n Things Q2 same store sales up 6 pct. [CORRECTED 01:40 GMT 3/7]</headline>
<dateline>CLIFTON, N.J. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	   $185.7    $147.6     +25.8	  +6.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $365.6    $285.8     +27.9	 +5.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    quarter is   13 weeks ended	 June 28.</p>
<p>    Full company name is		     Linens &amp; Things Inc</p>
<p>Company operates 138 sutperstores in 35 states.</p>
<p>Superstore same-store sales (corrects from &quot;sales&quot;) increased 7.5 percent in the second quarter and 7.7 percent in the first 26 weeks of the year.</p>
<p>During the first two quarters (corrects from &quot;second quarter&quot;) the company opened eight new stores and closed nine stores.</p>
<p>The company said it remains on track to open 20-25 new superstores in 1997.</p>
</text>
